<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Unholy Word</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Necromancer (guild level 40)
Mana: 10
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast unholy word &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast unholy word</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The first and weakest of the prayers to the dark forces against the good: 
the caster calls on evil to wound the target. Any target whose alignment 
is above neutral can be struck, and the truly good are hurt more; on the evil and the neutral, nothing 
happens. The better your divine power and sphere, the more it hurts. It 
does better against heavy armour than against light, and a shield can 
block it. No free hands are needed.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on scrolls. 
Stronger prayers follow: unholy touch, unholy grasp and unholy shout.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
